        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Task status: Planned → In Progress → Completed. A Planned task can be edited, reassigned or Cancelled.&lt;br&gt;• Ingredients are checked when the task is created and re-checked when the Baker clicks Start; they are deducted at Start using the planned quantity.&lt;br&gt;• On shortage the Admin chooses: reduce to the feasible qty (re-calculate), create a Purchase Order (UC-31), or cancel.&lt;br&gt;• Good quantity added to Product Stock = Actual Yield − Defect Qty.&lt;br&gt;• Dashed step = performed outside the system. Optional, not drawn: a scheduled job notifies Admin when a task passes its deadline without being Completed." vertex="1">
